<title>USA: Clinton to make statement on UPS settlement.</title>
<headline>Clinton to make statement on UPS settlement.</headline>
<dateline>EDGARTOWN, Mass. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The White House said President Bill Clinton would make an appearance around noon EDT (1600 GMT) to welcome the tentative agreement between United Parcel Service and the Teamsters union.</p>
<p>Clinton is vacationing on the Massachusetts island of Martha's Vineyard.</p>
</text>
